  "notes": "Data use (HPRC, https://humanpangenome.org/data-use/): the data are in the public domain (CC0 on the AWS Registry of Open Data). HPRC expects users not to sell all or part of the Pangenome Reference on any media, not to seek intellectual property protection that would block access to or use of any element of it, and not to take any action that could reasonably be expected to result in participant re-identification, including contacting or communicating with participants. Acknowledgement for publications: \"We would like to acknowledge the Human Pangenome Reference Consortium (BioProject ID: PRJNA730823) and its funder, the National Human Genome Research Institute (NHGRI).\" Contact: Yakiv Shavidze, aceapex.contour@outlook.com.",
